('UK_SIA_LICENCE_KH','security_operations','https://www.gov.uk/guidance/apply-for-an-sia-licence','2026-09-16','SIA-licenser gäller tre år, utom fordonsblockering (endast Nordirland), som gäller ett år. Status kan ändras före slutdatum; kontrollera SIA:s register.','SIA licences last three years, except vehicle immobilisation (Northern Ireland only), which lasts one year. Status can change before expiry; check the SIA register.'),
('UK_SIA_LICENCE_NFL','security_operations','https://www.gov.uk/guidance/apply-for-an-sia-licence','2026-09-16','SIA-licenser gäller tre år, utom fordonsblockering (endast Nordirland), som gäller ett år. Status kan ändras före slutdatum; kontrollera SIA:s register.','SIA licences last three years, except vehicle immobilisation (Northern Ireland only), which lasts one year. Status can change before expiry; check the SIA register.'),
